    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Naanim Sculptural Walnut Dining Table | KASODI</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Discover the Naanim walnut veneer dining table by Kave Home, selected by KASODI for its radial wood grain and sculptural architectural base." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="product-detail-page">
      <div class="product-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a><span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/home">Home Collection</a><span>&middot;</span>
        <a href="/home/furniture">Furniture</a><span>&middot;</span>
        <span>Naanim Sculptural Walnut Dining Table</span>
      </div>
      <section class="product-detail-hero">
        <div class="product-detail-image">
          <img src="/images/furniture/kave-home-naanim-sculptural-walnut-dining-table.png" alt="Naanim walnut veneer dining table by Kave Home in a warm KASODI dining room" />
        </div>
        <div class="product-detail-content">
          <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">HOME · FURNITURE</p>
          <h1>Naanim Sculptural Walnut Dining Table</h1>
          <p class="product-detail-brand">Kave Home</p>
          <p class="product-detail-intro">
            A beautiful balance of architectural form and natural warmth. With its expressive wooden base and rich walnut veneer, Naanim brings sculptural elegance to the dining room. Its radial tabletop grain draws the eye towards the centre, while angled wooden legs give the table a distinctive silhouette.
          </p>
          <div class="product-detail-divider"></div>
          <div class="product-detail-meta">
            <div><span>Material</span><strong>Walnut veneer · MDF · Rubberwood</strong></div>
            <div><span>Dimensions</span><strong>180 × 110 × 75 cm</strong></div>
            <div><span>Colour</span><strong>Walnut brown</strong></div>
            <div><span>Finish</span><strong>Clear lacquer</strong></div>
            <div><span>Weight</span><strong>30 kg</strong></div>
            <div><span>Details</span><strong>Adjustable feet · Sculptural base</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="affiliate-action">
            <a href={affiliateUrl} target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="product-shop-button">Find It Here →</a>
            <p class="affiliate-note">Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="why-we-love">
        <div class="why-we-love-label">KASODI NOTE</div>
        <div class="why-we-love-content">
          <h2>Why we love it</h2>
          <p>Naanim is a wonderful example of how a dining table can become the defining feature of a room without relying on excessive decoration. The walnut veneer creates a radial grain pattern that converges towards the centre of the tabletop.</p>
          <p>Beneath it, angled rubberwood legs form a dynamic architectural composition. Their warm finish complements the walnut tones and gives the table a distinctive personality.</p>
          <p>We love pairing this rich wood colour with natural linen, softly upholstered chairs and understated ceramics.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="product-care">
        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">MATERIALS &amp; CARE</p>
        <h2>Natural warmth, architectural character</h2>
        <p>Naanim combines a walnut veneer tabletop over MDF with a rubberwood base. The tabletop and legs have a protective nitrocellulose lacquer finish, while adjustable feet help compensate for uneven floors.</p>
        <p>Clean with a damp cloth and mild cleaner, then dry immediately. Use coasters and tablecloths to protect the surface. Avoid abrasive cleaners, solvents, bleach and sharp objects.</p>
        <p><strong>Assembly:</strong> Two people and approximately 20 minutes are recommended.</p>
        <p><strong>Good to know:</strong> Made in Malaysia. Measurements may vary by ±2 cm.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="styling-ideas">
        <div class="styling-heading"><p>KASODI STYLING</p><h2>Style it with</h2></div>
        <div class="styling-grid">
          <div class="styling-card"><span>01</span><h3>Soft, Upholstered Dining Chairs</h3><p>Pair the warm walnut finish with chairs in oatmeal linen, textured ivory or soft taupe to balance the angular base.</p></div>
          <div class="styling-card"><span>02</span><h3>Collected Ceramics</h3><p>A handmade ceramic vase or sculptural bowl adds an artisanal touch without distracting from the tabletop's beautiful grain.</p></div>
          <div class="styling-card"><span>03</span><h3>Warm, Natural Layers</h3><p>Combine walnut with travertine, woven textures and linen curtains for a sophisticated, welcoming dining space.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="continue-exploring">
        <div class="continue-exploring-heading"><p>FURNITURE</p><h2>Continue Exploring</h2></div>
        <div class="continue-exploring-grid">
          <a href="/home/furniture/granite-terracotta-armchair" class="continue-card">
            <div class="continue-card-image"><img src="/images/furniture/kave-home-granite-terracotta-armchair.png" alt="Granite Terracotta Armchair" /></div>
            <div class="continue-card-info"><span>FURNITURE</span><h3>Granite Terracotta Armchair</h3><p>Kave Home</p><strong>Discover →</strong></div>
          </a>
          <a href="/home/furniture/granite-beige-2-seater-sofa" class="continue-card">
            <div class="continue-card-image"><img src="/images/furniture/kave-home-granite-beige-2-seater-sofa.png" alt="Granite Beige 2-Seater Sofa" /></div>
            <div class="continue-card-info"><span>FURNITURE</span><h3>Granite Beige 2-Seater Sofa</h3><p>Kave Home</p><strong>Discover →</strong></div>
          </a>
          <a href="/home/furniture/aduma-oak-shelving-unit" class="continue-card">
            <div class="continue-card-image"><img src="/images/furniture/kave-home-aduma-oak-shelving-unit.png" alt="Aduma Sculptural Oak Shelving Unit" /></div>
            <div class="continue-card-info"><span>FURNITURE</span><h3>Aduma Sculptural Oak Shelving Unit</h3><p>Kave Home</p><strong>Discover →</strong></div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="product-final-cta">
        <p class="product-detail-eyebrow">KAVE HOME · NAANIM COLLECTION</p>
        <h2>A dining table with architectural soul.</h2>
        <a href={affiliateUrl} target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener noreferrer" class="product-shop-button">Find It Here →</a>
        <p class="affiliate-note affiliate-note-light">Affiliate link · KASODI may earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
  
<style>
  .continue-card-image img {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  object-fit: cover;
